-art"},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"優生保健法與人工生殖法"}]}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"li","properties":{},"children":[{"type":"text","value":"生產事故救濟：2016 年公布《生產事故救濟條例》，生產造成產婦或新生兒死亡、重傷時可申請救濟，不必先證明過失(條文細節待核對全國法規資料庫)"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"}]},{"type":"text","value":"\n"},{"type":"element","tagName":"k-questions","properties":{"tag":"","adm":"","keyword":"","drug":"","group":"","ids":"113-3_OP_001","limit":"","qkey":"obstetric-nursing-foundations#ethics-law"},"children":[]}]}},{"id":"questions","depth":2,"number":"九、","title":"相關考題","children":[],"content":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"element","tagName":"k-questions","properties":{"tag":"","adm":"","keyword":"以家庭為中心|溫柔生產|友善生產|拉梅茲|產科護理","drug":"","group":"","ids":"","limit":"10","qkey":"obstetric-nursing-foundations#questions"},"children":[]}]}}],"embeds":{}}